# Paths excluded from AI agents / ripgrep searches to save tokens.
# (.ignore is honored by ripgrep; same list is in .geminiignore.)

# Local SDKs, runtime data, backups
**/.tools/
**/.run/
**/data/media/
**/data/private-media/
**/backend/media/

# Dependencies and build output
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/.venv/
**/build/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/coverage/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/

# Large binary / reference assets
**/docs/design-reference/
**/docs/archive/
**/frontend/public/
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.gif
*.ico
*.zip

# Generated / lock / noisy files
**/package-lock.json
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts
*.log
*.dump
*.min.js
*.map

# Secrets
.env
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
